spes: start the topaz touch driver from the SD root path; boot-args sweettouchavdd (GPIO 98 on spes, SOUTH tile), sweettouchrawx/rawy (raw range -> 1080x2400), sweettouchprobe=1 (read chip id and Synaptics 0x20 only, never report), sweettouchid=0x<id 0xA3><id 0x9F>. Defaults keep topaz behaviour.

